<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lockheed Martin raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lockheed Martin raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley raised its rating for Lockheed Martin Corp Friday to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed on Thursday at 79-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
